1
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:05,060
[Episode 8]

2
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:12,370
You have great taste.

3
00:00:12,370 --> 00:00:16,540
My mom really liked the scarf.

4
00:00:16,540 --> 00:00:18,730
I think you succeeded.

5
00:00:18,730 --> 00:00:22,990
If you were trying to seduce me, you're doing well.

6
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,190
I'm starting to become interested in you.

7
00:00:29,090 --> 00:00:32,200
But this is the end.

8
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:37,350
I'm too grown up to be seduced by a playboy like you.

9
00:00:37,350 --> 00:00:41,110
Unfortunately, I can now distinguish love from passion.

10
00:01:30,993 --> 00:01:42,060
[Song Eunchae]

11
00:01:42,060 --> 00:01:46,090
Did you sleep well, Eunchae?

12
00:02:49,690 --> 00:02:52,380
- Warm, fresh seaweed rolls for sale!
- Rice cakes!

13
00:02:53,300 --> 00:02:54,790
Thank you.

14
00:02:56,450 --> 00:02:59,800
Seaweed rolls for sale!

15
00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:03,500
Rice cakes for sale!

16
00:03:03,500 --> 00:03:05,880
Galchi, should we sing the seaweed rolls song?

17
00:03:05,880 --> 00:03:06,980
Sure!

18
00:03:06,980 --> 00:03:08,940
1, 2, 3, 4!

19
00:03:08,940 --> 00:03:12,610
♪ Roll me tightly ♪

20
00:03:12,610 --> 00:03:16,540
♪ Press me gently ♪

21
00:03:16,540 --> 00:03:20,140
♪ Like rice within the roll ♪

22
00:03:20,140 --> 00:03:23,380
♪ I want to stick right onto you ♪

23
00:03:23,380 --> 00:03:26,840
♪ Hold me ♪

24
00:03:26,840 --> 00:03:29,680
♪ Hold me ♪

25
00:03:31,940 --> 00:03:34,540
I'm gonna go make a phone call.

26
00:03:36,537 --> 00:03:39,135
♪ I want to stick right onto you ♪

27
00:03:49,510 --> 00:03:51,470
Hello?

28
00:03:51,470 --> 00:03:53,150
Minchae.

29
00:03:53,150 --> 00:03:54,690
Eunchae!

30
00:03:55,720 --> 00:03:58,550
Are Mom and Dad doing well?

31
00:04:03,280 --> 00:04:08,180
Tell them not to worry, because I'm doing fine.

32
00:04:09,150 --> 00:04:12,970
Yeah, I'm really okay.

33
00:04:13,710 --> 00:04:17,190
- Who's that?
- You should have called.

34
00:04:17,190 --> 00:04:19,200
Is that Eunchae? Hey, Eunchae?

35
00:04:19,200 --> 00:04:21,890
Give it here! Give it to me! I'm still talking to her!

36
00:04:21,890 --> 00:04:24,810
- Listen to your mother.
- Listen to your big sister.

37
00:04:24,810 --> 00:04:28,530
Give it to me now!

38
00:04:30,090 --> 00:04:36,040
Eunchae. It's Mom. Have you eaten?

39
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:39,380
Hey, Eunchae. It's me. I shrunk your panties.

40
00:04:39,380 --> 00:04:41,850
Come home soon.

41
00:04:41,850 --> 00:04:45,390
Eunchae, Sukchae took your cell
and made international calls.

42
00:04:45,390 --> 00:04:47,700
Hey, stop!

43
00:04:48,640 --> 00:04:51,380
We're going to move out, Eunchae!

44
00:04:51,380 --> 00:04:54,980
We're going to move out even if
we have to borrow lots of money,

45
00:04:54,980 --> 00:04:58,400
so come home as soon as you can.

46
00:04:58,400 --> 00:05:00,440
Come home soon!

47
00:05:00,440 --> 00:05:03,300
I'm really doing well, Mom.

48
00:05:03,300 --> 00:05:07,800
I will return tough as a rock.

49
00:05:07,800 --> 00:05:11,470
So don't worry and take care. Okay?

50
00:05:21,150 --> 00:05:23,660
Have you any love for your sister?

51
00:05:23,660 --> 00:05:26,240
You were so unloving towards her over the phone.

52
00:05:31,750 --> 00:05:35,690
I should a lotto ticket
while I'm out at the grocery store.

53
00:05:35,690 --> 00:05:42,170
If I win, I'll buy a house twice
this size just across the street.

54
00:05:42,170 --> 00:05:46,530
Mom, if you got less face lifts and
less botox, we'd be rich by now.

55
00:05:46,530 --> 00:05:48,760
We'd own a building by now.

56
00:05:48,760 --> 00:05:50,180
I hear you.

57
00:05:51,280 --> 00:05:53,040
What about you?

58
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:55,230
You don't earn a single penny

59
00:05:55,230 --> 00:06:00,690
yet use your dad and sister's
credit cards to buy expensive clothes and shoes!

60
00:06:00,690 --> 00:06:03,320
If it weren't for you, we would be rich, you idiot!

61
00:06:03,320 --> 00:06:05,210
I agree.

62
00:06:05,210 --> 00:06:06,580
Hello?

63
00:06:06,580 --> 00:06:08,030
Yun!

64
00:06:08,030 --> 00:06:10,280
What brings you to this dump, superstar Yun?

65
00:06:10,280 --> 00:06:14,040
May I join you for dinner?
I wanted to have dinner with you.

66
00:06:16,710 --> 00:06:18,680
Sure, come sit here.

67
00:06:26,950 --> 00:06:30,710
Have you heard from Eunchae?

68
00:06:30,710 --> 00:06:32,500
Speaking of, just a while ago...

69
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:36,010
No. She didn't call.

70
00:06:36,010 --> 00:06:38,590
You came to check up on Eunchae, huh?

71
00:06:38,590 --> 00:06:40,280
Check up? No, no.

72
00:06:41,830 --> 00:06:44,610
But that girl must be nuts!

73
00:06:44,610 --> 00:06:47,115
She doesn't even know how dangerous it is out there.

74
00:06:47,115 --> 00:06:49,620
She's immature yet doesn't know fear.

75
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:54,100
Mrs. Song. Are you just going to sit there?

76
00:06:54,100 --> 00:06:56,770
Shouldn't you file a missing person's report?

77
00:06:56,770 --> 00:07:00,950
A girl is like a porcelain bowl.
Once outside, she will get smashed.

78
00:07:00,950 --> 00:07:03,130
Just finish your food.

79
00:07:03,130 --> 00:07:05,810
Whether Eunchae picks her ear with a streetlight pole

80
00:07:05,810 --> 00:07:09,990
or peel an apple with a nail clipper, what's it to you?

81
00:07:11,120 --> 00:07:12,300
Exactly.

82
00:07:19,290 --> 00:07:21,640
Rice cakes! We have fresh and warm rice cake!

83
00:07:21,640 --> 00:07:25,930
Seaweed rolls! Buy seaweed rolls!

84
00:07:25,930 --> 00:07:27,080
Buy seaweed rolls!

85
00:07:27,080 --> 00:07:30,160
Seaweed rolls!

86
00:07:30,160 --> 00:07:31,390
Buy seaweed rolls!

87
00:07:31,390 --> 00:07:32,920
Awesome tasting seaweed rolls!

88
00:07:32,920 --> 00:07:34,770
Seaweed rolls! They're delicious!

89
00:07:40,850 --> 00:07:42,520
Don't go.

90
00:07:45,870 --> 00:07:47,910
Don't go, Eunchae.

91
00:07:50,280 --> 00:07:52,610
I won't burden you.

92
00:07:52,610 --> 00:07:59,150
My sister makes really good seaweed rolls,
but she doesn't make good kimchi.

93
00:07:59,150 --> 00:08:00,540
Make me kimchi before you go.

94
00:08:17,390 --> 00:08:18,880
Seaweed rolls for sale!

95
00:08:24,740 --> 00:08:27,910
Hold on. Do it for me too.

96
00:08:34,890 --> 00:08:36,800
You have some on your face too.

97
00:09:08,880 --> 00:09:12,750
Yun Seo-kyeong.

98
00:09:13,370 --> 00:09:15,930
Muhyeok.

99
00:09:19,140 --> 00:09:20,350
Brother.

100
00:09:22,070 --> 00:09:24,870
And Galchi.

101
00:09:33,338 --> 00:09:36,140
[Our countree...]

102
00:09:36,140 --> 00:09:38,350
That's not right.

103
00:09:44,360 --> 00:09:45,580
Dear Lord,

104
00:09:46,890 --> 00:09:50,240
if you really do exist,

105
00:09:50,240 --> 00:09:54,420
I promise you this.

106
00:09:58,130 --> 00:10:01,130
About Song Eunchae.

107
00:10:01,130 --> 00:10:06,140
If you'll let me have her for my remaining days...

108
00:10:07,340 --> 00:10:12,830
Three servings of crab sticks.
And four radishes. And one of those.

109
00:10:16,180 --> 00:10:18,900
Give us a bit of a discount! Thank you.

110
00:10:21,510 --> 00:10:25,930
If you let her comfort me for the time I have left...

111
00:10:28,740 --> 00:10:31,410
If you don't hurt me again...

112
00:10:33,470 --> 00:10:37,880
I could stop everything right now.

113
00:10:37,880 --> 00:10:41,790
Uncle!

114
00:10:43,140 --> 00:10:45,350
Uncle!

115
00:10:54,739 --> 00:10:56,363
Good night.

116
00:11:13,470 --> 00:11:19,760
The hatred, the anger, I'll let it all go.

117
00:11:22,020 --> 00:11:25,680
And go in peace.

118
00:11:27,360 --> 00:11:33,570
Lord, I make this promise to you.

119
00:11:46,660 --> 00:11:50,020
Damn it, isn't this crow's feet?

120
00:11:50,020 --> 00:11:52,000
Oh, no! What do I do?

121
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:55,030
Eunchae! I got a crow's feet!

122
00:11:56,180 --> 00:11:57,710
Eunchae!

123
00:12:04,530 --> 00:12:06,760
I don't like this style.

124
00:12:06,760 --> 00:12:13,570
Flower shirts don't look good on me.
They're my least favorite clothes.

125
00:12:14,340 --> 00:12:18,650
I'm sorry, I didn't know. I'll go look for other ones.

126
00:12:36,650 --> 00:12:38,900
- Eunchae!
- Yunchae!

127
00:12:40,550 --> 00:12:43,100
Your favorite flavor of ice cream. Eat up.

128
00:12:44,440 --> 00:12:46,580
Slow down.

129
00:12:46,580 --> 00:12:49,540
Who's this?

130
00:12:49,540 --> 00:12:52,490
She's a good friend.

131
00:12:55,370 --> 00:12:58,510
But I don't think she's doing well.

132
00:12:59,580 --> 00:13:02,080
She had an accident when she was young.

133
00:13:02,080 --> 00:13:05,800
She's very kind and nice.

134
00:13:05,800 --> 00:13:08,980
So are you staying at her house now?

135
00:13:08,980 --> 00:13:10,150
Yeah.

136
00:13:10,920 --> 00:13:12,850
Give it to me.

137
00:13:12,850 --> 00:13:14,170
Oh, hold on.

138
00:13:20,180 --> 00:13:22,880
This'll is probably about $200, right?

139
00:13:22,880 --> 00:13:26,440
You don't even have money?
Don't you have a credit card?

140
00:13:26,440 --> 00:13:30,400
Oh yeah, Sukjae took your credit cards.

141
00:13:34,490 --> 00:13:35,780
Hey...

142
00:13:35,780 --> 00:13:39,200
- My sister bought it.
- It's mine!

143
00:13:46,330 --> 00:13:50,340
Isn't it really hard to get over Yun?

144
00:13:50,340 --> 00:13:52,110
Not really,

145
00:13:52,110 --> 00:13:54,520
I guess it's stupid of me to ask.

146
00:13:54,520 --> 00:13:58,510
But really, I think I'm very much over Yun now.

147
00:13:58,510 --> 00:14:02,830
You don't have to lie to me!
You don't think I know love?

148
00:14:02,830 --> 00:14:05,840
I'm going to use the bathroom.

149
00:14:05,840 --> 00:14:07,450
Okay. Do you want me to come with you?

150
00:14:07,450 --> 00:14:09,210
No, it's okay.

151
00:14:14,290 --> 00:14:19,150
When I closed my eyes to sleep, I always saw Yun.

152
00:14:19,150 --> 00:14:26,800
Whether Yun was with me or not, he was all I could see.

153
00:14:26,800 --> 00:14:29,050
I told you, I know how you feel.

154
00:14:30,300 --> 00:14:34,200
But now, I see someone else.

155
00:14:35,230 --> 00:14:41,410
Sometimes I still see Yun,
but now I keep seeing the other person.

156
00:14:41,410 --> 00:14:42,860
Who is it?

157
00:14:47,460 --> 00:14:48,990
Oh, my! Galchi!

158
00:14:50,350 --> 00:14:51,890
Huh? Galchi?

159
00:14:51,890 --> 00:14:54,020
Oh, no! I was to meet with Galchi's teacher.

160
00:14:54,020 --> 00:14:56,670
I'll be right back. Take care of Seo-kyeong!

161
00:14:56,670 --> 00:14:59,650
Galchi's teacher?

162
00:15:03,830 --> 00:15:05,770
Hello?

163
00:15:05,770 --> 00:15:07,680
Yeah, Mom.

164
00:15:07,680 --> 00:15:12,260
What? Laundry? You left it on top of the stove?

165
00:15:12,260 --> 00:15:14,690
I'm not at home now.

166
00:15:16,740 --> 00:15:21,170
Can't you try Sukchae? Where are you?

167
00:15:24,260 --> 00:15:27,620
Okay. I'll go home right now,

168
00:15:50,020 --> 00:15:51,480
Galchi!

169
00:15:51,480 --> 00:15:52,780
Eunchae!

170
00:15:52,780 --> 00:15:55,030
Sorry, did you wait long?

171
00:15:55,030 --> 00:15:56,810
Come on. The teacher must be waiting.

172
00:15:56,810 --> 00:15:59,540
I don't have to go to school.

173
00:15:59,540 --> 00:16:02,370
Who's going to sell the seaweed rolls?

174
00:16:03,330 --> 00:16:09,280
Well, I can help your mom, or your uncle can help.

175
00:16:09,280 --> 00:16:11,930
I'm sure there are others who can help your mom.

176
00:16:11,930 --> 00:16:18,210
You can go to school without any worries, okay?

177
00:16:18,210 --> 00:16:19,450
Let's go.

178
00:16:29,370 --> 00:16:30,600
Nervous?

179
00:16:32,710 --> 00:16:33,980
Here.

180
00:16:36,850 --> 00:16:38,020
Let's go.

181
00:16:49,950 --> 00:16:51,600
Let's go.

182
00:16:59,950 --> 00:17:02,770
I'll be right back. I have to pee
and turn off the stove. Stay here.

183
00:17:02,770 --> 00:17:06,130
Don't go anywhere, just stay put.

184
00:17:06,130 --> 00:17:07,210
Okay.

185
00:17:16,930 --> 00:17:19,110
Wow! Fish!

186
00:17:20,070 --> 00:17:22,470
Fishie! Fishie!

187
00:17:36,410 --> 00:17:40,050
I'm so tired. When are we doing the radio show?

188
00:17:40,050 --> 00:17:41,880
7:30 p.m.

189
00:17:42,670 --> 00:17:44,960
- I'll see you at around 6:30 then.
- Okay.

190
00:17:44,960 --> 00:17:46,650
I'll see you in a bit.

191
00:17:52,710 --> 00:17:56,130
Fishie!

192
00:17:57,300 --> 00:18:01,630
Fishie!

193
00:18:03,100 --> 00:18:04,690
Fishie!

194
00:18:06,190 --> 00:18:07,440
Hey.

195
00:18:12,770 --> 00:18:13,930
Hey!

196
00:18:15,640 --> 00:18:17,020
Who are you?

197
00:18:19,860 --> 00:18:22,920
Who are you, and why are you on my property?

198
00:18:25,790 --> 00:18:26,910
Who...

199
00:18:28,890 --> 00:18:33,730
Hey... That pin! I got it for Eunchae on her birthday!

200
00:18:33,730 --> 00:18:35,600
This?

201
00:18:35,600 --> 00:18:37,620
Where did you get it?

202
00:18:37,620 --> 00:18:40,490
Eunchae gave it to me earlier.

203
00:18:40,490 --> 00:18:43,350
You know Eunchae?

204
00:18:43,350 --> 00:18:44,350
Yeah.

205
00:18:44,350 --> 00:18:45,830
You saw her?

206
00:18:47,420 --> 00:18:49,750
Is Eunchae home?

207
00:18:49,750 --> 00:18:51,040
No.

208
00:18:51,740 --> 00:18:53,520
Where is Eunchae?

209
00:18:53,520 --> 00:18:54,890
Ice cream.

210
00:18:56,210 --> 00:18:57,300
Huh?

211
00:19:01,120 --> 00:19:02,950
Wow! A waterfall!

212
00:19:08,300 --> 00:19:09,910
Waterfall!

213
00:19:38,900 --> 00:19:42,530
Song Minchae! What happened?

214
00:19:42,530 --> 00:19:44,400
Where are you now?

215
00:19:44,400 --> 00:19:46,050
We got a problem!

216
00:19:46,050 --> 00:19:50,970
Yun has taken her hostage.

217
00:19:50,970 --> 00:19:52,190
What?

218
00:19:52,190 --> 00:19:56,760
Yun said if you want her back,
then you have to come here yourself.

219
00:19:58,510 --> 00:20:00,858
Roar! Roar!

220
00:20:01,500 --> 00:20:02,750
Isn't he cute?

221
00:20:04,160 --> 00:20:06,000
Want it?

222
00:20:06,000 --> 00:20:07,790
It's all right.

223
00:20:09,650 --> 00:20:11,000
Have a lollipop.

224
00:20:12,760 --> 00:20:16,000
Wait a minute. Is this one cuter?
Which one do you like better?

225
00:20:19,490 --> 00:20:21,890
Did you talk to Eunchae?

226
00:20:21,890 --> 00:20:22,970
Yes.

227
00:20:26,340 --> 00:20:28,610
Is there anything else you want to eat?

228
00:20:29,790 --> 00:20:32,900
This one? Here.

229
00:20:43,280 --> 00:20:44,920
Don't go.

230
00:20:47,980 --> 00:20:49,940
Don't go, Eunchae.

231
00:20:57,000 --> 00:21:02,670
I won't burden you. Don't go.

232
00:21:43,970 --> 00:21:48,610
Wow! She's so pretty!

233
00:21:54,430 --> 00:21:56,850
Yummy, yummy!

234
00:22:13,570 --> 00:22:14,990
Wow!

235
00:22:19,260 --> 00:22:21,100
Wow!

236
00:22:52,700 --> 00:22:55,140
So pretty!

237
00:23:00,150 --> 00:23:01,310
Necklace.

238
00:23:08,100 --> 00:23:10,380
Oh, no...

239
00:23:32,040 --> 00:23:33,270
Minchae!

240
00:23:34,850 --> 00:23:36,520
Hello.

241
00:23:36,520 --> 00:23:38,960
Why are you standing there like you
have to go to the bathroom?

242
00:23:38,960 --> 00:23:41,480
Um... I'm just...

243
00:23:41,480 --> 00:23:44,040
What are you doing? Do you have to go number two?

244
00:23:44,040 --> 00:23:46,810
No! I just went!

245
00:23:46,810 --> 00:23:49,860
- Is Yun home yet?
- Yes.

246
00:23:50,890 --> 00:23:55,090
Son! My son!

247
00:23:55,090 --> 00:23:58,870
How was your day? Did you have a good day?

248
00:23:58,870 --> 00:24:00,290
Mom, I'm so tired.

249
00:24:00,290 --> 00:24:05,040
Why? What is it? Because of Eunchae?

250
00:24:05,040 --> 00:24:08,120
- Forget it.
- I want to go home.

251
00:24:10,140 --> 00:24:13,750
Oh! It's the pretty lady!

252
00:24:14,950 --> 00:24:17,740
Who is she?

253
00:24:19,240 --> 00:24:24,870
What the... That's my necklace! It's my necklace!

254
00:24:24,870 --> 00:24:28,480
Miss, who are you? Which room were you in?

255
00:24:28,480 --> 00:24:29,800
There.

256
00:24:30,870 --> 00:24:32,230
Yun! Who is this girl?

257
00:24:32,230 --> 00:24:36,220
Just someone I know. Don't scare her, Mom.

258
00:24:37,110 --> 00:24:39,490
I don't think she's normal.

259
00:24:41,190 --> 00:24:43,960
Stay here. Don't move.

260
00:25:06,260 --> 00:25:08,030
They didn't say where they were going?

261
00:25:08,030 --> 00:25:12,490
No. She told me to go home,
and that she would be home with Mom soon.

262
00:25:17,620 --> 00:25:19,900
I'll be back.

263
00:25:19,900 --> 00:25:22,590
When Eunchae comes, tell her not to go anywhere.

264
00:25:22,590 --> 00:25:23,650
Okay.

265
00:25:31,560 --> 00:25:34,380
I want to go home.

266
00:25:34,380 --> 00:25:37,640
I want to go back home.

267
00:25:37,640 --> 00:25:42,590
Galchi, Galchi.

268
00:25:44,390 --> 00:25:47,610
Don't cry, don't cry!

269
00:25:47,610 --> 00:25:52,230
Why did you have to call the cops?
You could've just asked her nicely.

270
00:25:52,230 --> 00:25:55,280
She keeps denying that she took it!

271
00:25:55,280 --> 00:25:58,890
Galchi! Galchi!

272
00:25:58,890 --> 00:26:03,800
Where did you hide the ring?
You're not going to give it back?

273
00:26:03,800 --> 00:26:05,370
Galchi!

274
00:26:14,360 --> 00:26:16,700
Galchi!

275
00:26:18,650 --> 00:26:23,020
I think she really doesn't know.
Why don't you go look for it again?

276
00:26:23,790 --> 00:26:28,650
I looked everywhere!

277
00:26:28,650 --> 00:26:31,860
You know how much that diamond ring costs?

278
00:26:31,860 --> 00:26:35,910
It's priceless!

279
00:26:35,910 --> 00:26:40,340
Yun, why did you bring someone
like that into the house?

280
00:26:40,340 --> 00:26:44,310
Why did you bring a freak like her here
and cause this mess?

281
00:26:45,920 --> 00:26:49,750
Have you seen a small, twinkling, ring?

282
00:26:49,750 --> 00:26:50,990
Think about it.

283
00:26:50,990 --> 00:26:52,810
I want to go home.

284
00:26:52,810 --> 00:26:56,340
I think she's a pro, just acting like she's dumb.

285
00:26:56,340 --> 00:27:00,170
Did you hide it in your clothes?

286
00:27:00,170 --> 00:27:04,200
Or maybe you swallowed it?

287
00:27:05,980 --> 00:27:07,440
Galchi...

288
00:27:07,440 --> 00:27:11,200
Confess before the cops come
and make it more serious.

289
00:27:11,200 --> 00:27:14,740
If you confess now,
I'll forgive you without pressing charges.

290
00:27:14,740 --> 00:27:16,290
Tell me now!

291
00:27:17,230 --> 00:27:21,760
Uncle! Uncle!

292
00:27:21,760 --> 00:27:24,050
What's the problem?

293
00:27:24,050 --> 00:27:30,420
I've been waiting for you forever!
I've lost a six-carat diamond ring.

294
00:27:36,920 --> 00:27:40,040
I'm sorry, but could you take your socks off?

295
00:27:54,580 --> 00:28:00,480
Don't just frisk her. I told you.
She hid it in her clothes!

296
00:28:00,480 --> 00:28:03,170
Strip search her.

297
00:28:03,170 --> 00:28:06,190
You don't have evidence.
That's a violation of her rights.

298
00:28:06,190 --> 00:28:09,510
Thieves don't have rights!

299
00:28:09,510 --> 00:28:14,470
Where did you hide it?

300
00:28:14,470 --> 00:28:17,040
Seriously, where did you hide it? Huh?

301
00:28:17,040 --> 00:28:18,450
Uncle!

302
00:28:18,450 --> 00:28:23,280
You should have listened when I was asking nicely!

303
00:28:23,280 --> 00:28:24,960
Come on! Take this off, too!

304
00:28:24,960 --> 00:28:30,300
I don't want to! No!
I don't want to. Galchi! Galchi!

305
00:28:56,830 --> 00:29:04,370
Mister. I... Well...

306
00:29:04,370 --> 00:29:08,610
Where is my sister? Did she go home?

307
00:29:10,670 --> 00:29:15,490
No. She's inside.

308
00:29:23,910 --> 00:29:25,150
Mister!

309
00:29:28,980 --> 00:29:30,400
Uncle!

310
00:29:30,400 --> 00:29:31,830
Mr. Cha!

311
00:29:31,830 --> 00:29:35,440
What? You know her?

312
00:29:57,100 --> 00:29:58,460
Get on my back.

313
00:30:16,310 --> 00:30:17,700
Dear Lord,

314
00:30:19,500 --> 00:30:23,030
if you really do exist,

315
00:30:23,030 --> 00:30:29,000
I promise you this.

316
00:30:40,340 --> 00:30:41,600
Mister.

317
00:30:45,370 --> 00:30:46,660
Mister.

318
00:30:50,030 --> 00:30:52,400
Let's go home.

319
00:30:53,760 --> 00:30:56,260
Mommy!

320
00:31:08,980 --> 00:31:10,900
Mommy.

321
00:31:11,810 --> 00:31:17,300
If you'll let me have her for my remaining days...

322
00:31:18,420 --> 00:31:19,860
Song Eunchae.

323
00:31:19,860 --> 00:31:23,240
Let go. Let go!

324
00:31:24,300 --> 00:31:25,620
Mister.

325
00:31:28,940 --> 00:31:34,590
If you let her comfort me for the time I have left...

326
00:31:36,920 --> 00:31:40,690
Mister!

327
00:31:42,630 --> 00:31:44,030
Mister!

328
00:31:44,030 --> 00:31:49,480
If you don't hurt me again...

329
00:31:51,540 --> 00:31:56,110
I could stop everything right now.

330
00:32:01,440 --> 00:32:03,090
Mister!

331
00:32:05,210 --> 00:32:07,000
Mister!

332
00:32:09,900 --> 00:32:11,550
Mister!

333
00:32:22,390 --> 00:32:31,680
The hatred, the anger, I'll let it all go.

334
00:32:31,680 --> 00:32:38,280
And go in peace.

335
00:32:42,630 --> 00:32:52,740
Lord, I make this promise to you.

336
00:33:14,410 --> 00:33:16,580
What the...

337
00:33:16,580 --> 00:33:19,480
You were at Muhyeok's place this whole time?

338
00:33:21,840 --> 00:33:25,160
Were you staying with Muhyeok this whole time?

339
00:33:27,370 --> 00:33:28,980
Are you insane?

340
00:33:30,720 --> 00:33:32,450
Don't yell.

341
00:33:33,680 --> 00:33:35,280
Eunchae.

342
00:33:38,570 --> 00:33:41,510
Why are you yelling?

343
00:33:41,510 --> 00:33:43,940
Why are you yelling at me?

344
00:33:43,940 --> 00:33:47,010
What did I ever do to you to get yelled at?

345
00:33:48,510 --> 00:33:53,690
And no, I'm not insane. I'm doing just fine, Yun.

346
00:33:56,070 --> 00:33:58,890
What's wrong with you?
You're not acting like yourself!

347
00:33:58,890 --> 00:34:02,010
You messed up today.

348
00:34:02,010 --> 00:34:08,900
To Seo-kyeong and Muhyeok.
You did them wrong, big time.

349
00:34:18,760 --> 00:34:24,500
That stupid girl was Mr. Cha's older sister?

350
00:34:24,500 --> 00:34:28,580
Goodness. Regardless, she's a thief.

351
00:34:28,580 --> 00:34:35,990
It's not like the ring grew legs
and walked off by itself.

352
00:34:35,990 --> 00:34:39,880
Oh. My blood pressure's rising!

353
00:34:40,960 --> 00:34:44,770
My ring! What about my ring?

354
00:34:46,410 --> 00:34:53,350
What do I do?

355
00:34:56,550 --> 00:35:02,100
I found something that's not ring nor a necklace.

356
00:35:02,100 --> 00:35:04,680
What? What is that?... Bring it here.

357
00:35:04,680 --> 00:35:05,880
[Forever]

358
00:35:05,880 --> 00:35:08,630
What is it? Bring it here. What's wrong?

359
00:35:15,810 --> 00:35:18,750
Oh, it's nothing.

360
00:35:18,750 --> 00:35:23,100
What will I do about my ring? Goodness...

361
00:35:23,100 --> 00:35:25,260
My ring!

362
00:35:37,384 --> 00:35:41,536
[Forever]

363
00:35:54,975 --> 00:35:57,911
[Together]

364
00:36:01,030 --> 00:36:06,560
She lost consciousness early,
so she wouldn't know she gave birth to twins.

365
00:36:12,450 --> 00:36:18,610
You and I will have to take this secret to our graves.

366
00:36:18,610 --> 00:36:20,310
Everything about today.

367
00:36:24,130 --> 00:36:26,250
I'm going to tell her the baby died.

368
00:36:34,020 --> 00:36:38,070
They weren't meant to be with their mother.

369
00:36:46,107 --> 00:36:49,620
[Forever]

370
00:36:49,620 --> 00:36:53,350
Build me a son, O Lord.

371
00:36:55,930 --> 00:37:00,210
Who will be strong enough to know when he is weak,

372
00:37:01,550 --> 00:37:06,020
and brave enough to face himself when he is afraid,

373
00:37:06,020 --> 00:37:10,690
one who will be proud and unbending in honest defeat...

374
00:37:14,470 --> 00:37:18,710
Lead him, I pray, not in the path of ease and comfort,

375
00:37:18,710 --> 00:37:23,350
but under the stress and spur of
difficulties and challenge...

376
00:37:23,350 --> 00:37:28,780
Here, let him learn to stand up in the storm.

377
00:37:31,000 --> 00:37:36,900
A son who'll master himself before
he seeks to master other men,

378
00:37:36,900 --> 00:37:43,580
one who'll reach into the future,
yet never forget the past.

379
00:37:55,100 --> 00:37:56,700
Who is that guy?

380
00:37:59,350 --> 00:38:05,520
I trust and support my son's decision
one hundred percent.

381
00:38:05,520 --> 00:38:10,700
If Yun chose her, I'm sure she's a good girl.

382
00:38:12,500 --> 00:38:14,450
We don't have a mother.

383
00:38:14,450 --> 00:38:16,430
We don't have a mother!

384
00:38:16,430 --> 00:38:19,150
Mommy! Mommy!

385
00:38:59,840 --> 00:39:01,460
Where are you going, Eunchae?

386
00:39:01,460 --> 00:39:04,440
Just out for a walk and to get some fresh air.

387
00:39:07,330 --> 00:39:08,860
My ring.

388
00:39:12,290 --> 00:39:16,040
Mom, don't get sick over such a trivial thing.

389
00:39:16,040 --> 00:39:21,020
Do you know how much it cost?

390
00:39:23,230 --> 00:39:27,390
I'll go buy you one.
I'll go out and buy you one, okay?

391
00:39:27,390 --> 00:39:31,430
It's not something you can just go out and buy.

392
00:39:41,580 --> 00:39:43,540
Let's eat some noodles, Eunchae.

393
00:39:44,970 --> 00:39:46,660
Let's make some noodles!

394
00:39:46,660 --> 00:39:47,930
Move!

395
00:39:47,930 --> 00:39:49,420
Come on! Let's make noodles!

396
00:39:49,420 --> 00:39:50,790
Didn't you hear me?

397
00:39:50,790 --> 00:39:53,870
Noodles! Let's have noodles!

398
00:39:55,730 --> 00:39:57,660
You eat it! Stuff yourself full with them!

399
00:39:57,660 --> 00:39:59,480
What's wrong with you?

400
00:39:59,480 --> 00:40:02,160
Are you on drugs?
You are, aren't you?

401
00:40:02,160 --> 00:40:04,670
If I had, I would have killed you by now!

402
00:40:04,670 --> 00:40:06,230
Song Eunchae!

403
00:40:06,230 --> 00:40:10,160
How old are you? Grow up!

404
00:40:10,160 --> 00:40:13,780
Noodles? How could you be hungry at a time like this?

405
00:40:13,780 --> 00:40:17,100
Because of you, some of us can't eat nor sleep.

406
00:40:17,100 --> 00:40:20,520
Why is that my fault, you brat?
Why is everyone blaming me?

407
00:40:20,520 --> 00:40:22,580
Why only me?

408
00:40:23,360 --> 00:40:25,460
You're pathetic, Yun.

409
00:40:25,460 --> 00:40:27,580
You're an embarrassment.

410
00:40:28,430 --> 00:40:32,820
You better not go. You better not leave.

411
00:40:32,820 --> 00:40:34,160
Come back here!

412
00:40:34,890 --> 00:40:36,380
Come back here!

413
00:40:37,830 --> 00:40:44,200
I'm not some dog that comes and goes
when you say so, you jerk!

414
00:40:46,400 --> 00:40:47,890
Song Eunchae!

415
00:40:52,480 --> 00:40:54,080
Song Eunchae!

416
00:40:57,870 --> 00:41:01,780
Mommy!

417
00:41:04,700 --> 00:41:07,110
Are you okay, Mom?

418
00:41:07,110 --> 00:41:09,430
Should I go out and buy some medicine?

419
00:41:10,330 --> 00:41:15,170
Mommy. Mom...

420
00:41:52,430 --> 00:41:54,330
Galchi!

421
00:41:54,330 --> 00:41:55,430
Eunchae!

422
00:41:55,430 --> 00:41:56,850
Didn't you go to school?

423
00:41:56,850 --> 00:41:59,460
No. Mom's really sick.

424
00:41:59,460 --> 00:42:00,940
Your mom is sick?

425
00:42:00,940 --> 00:42:03,320
I'm going to get some medicine right now.

426
00:42:03,320 --> 00:42:07,610
Still, you should go to school.

427
00:42:07,610 --> 00:42:08,900
Where is your uncle?

428
00:42:08,900 --> 00:42:12,740
I don't know. He was gone when I woke up.

429
00:42:12,740 --> 00:42:15,130
I'll be right back after I get the medicine.

430
00:42:43,780 --> 00:42:45,270
Seo-kyeong.

431
00:42:53,140 --> 00:42:56,950
I'm so sorry. It's all my fault.

432
00:42:57,810 --> 00:42:59,990
I'm so sorry...

433
00:43:02,370 --> 00:43:07,300
I didn't steal the ring. I didn't steal it.

434
00:43:09,000 --> 00:43:12,230
I know. I know.

435
00:43:13,180 --> 00:43:15,440
I'm really sorry.

436
00:43:28,160 --> 00:43:31,610
Hey, Yun. Yeah. I asked around.

437
00:43:32,700 --> 00:43:35,290
I don't think I can get exactly the same one
as your mom's,

438
00:43:35,290 --> 00:43:37,450
but I can probably get a similar one.

439
00:43:39,680 --> 00:43:42,000
Huh? I'm going out right now.

440
00:43:43,820 --> 00:43:48,930
If you get there earlier, just window shop.

441
00:43:58,070 --> 00:44:02,010
I was curious about something.
I have something to ask you.

442
00:44:11,710 --> 00:44:15,810
What's the difference between passion and love?

443
00:44:22,370 --> 00:44:26,550
For example, is this passion?

444
00:44:31,420 --> 00:44:33,180
I love you.

445
00:44:34,520 --> 00:44:38,860
It just happened. I love you.

446
00:45:11,360 --> 00:45:13,590
Why did she hang up suddenly?

447
00:45:14,710 --> 00:45:16,460
Did she get on the elevator?

448
00:45:20,270 --> 00:45:22,660
It's so complicated. Complicated,

449
00:45:24,140 --> 00:45:28,970
My mom, Eunchae, all so complicated.

450
00:45:30,590 --> 00:45:35,480
Minju! Your hubby is about to die
from all these complications.

451
00:45:45,860 --> 00:45:48,740
Why are you yelling?

452
00:45:48,740 --> 00:45:51,240
Why are you yelling at me?

453
00:45:51,240 --> 00:45:54,020
What did I ever do to you?

454
00:45:54,020 --> 00:45:56,390
You messed up today.

455
00:45:57,100 --> 00:46:04,270
To Seo-kyeong and Muhyeok.
You did them wrong, big time.

456
00:46:04,270 --> 00:46:09,270
That brat has changed. Definitely.

457
00:46:11,280 --> 00:46:13,820
Is she dating Muhyeok?

458
00:46:13,820 --> 00:46:16,920
Whatever! Go ahead! Date him!

459
00:46:16,920 --> 00:46:19,780
Like cockroaches that are perfect for each other.

460
00:46:21,480 --> 00:46:23,790
Then what was that about her liking me?

461
00:46:24,970 --> 00:46:28,030
She has no principles.

462
00:46:53,530 --> 00:46:58,500
If you let her comfort me for the time I have left...

463
00:46:59,300 --> 00:47:05,240
If you'll let me have her for my remaining days...

464
00:47:05,240 --> 00:47:10,140
I could go in peace.

465
00:47:57,540 --> 00:48:01,600
I love you. It just happened that way.

466
00:48:16,890 --> 00:48:20,800
[My Yun]

467
00:48:30,230 --> 00:48:32,650
Recipient did not answer.

468
00:48:43,940 --> 00:48:47,120
Recipient did not answer.

469
00:48:59,170 --> 00:49:09,710
♪ When mom goes to the island shore to get food ♪

470
00:49:10,770 --> 00:49:21,660
♪ The baby watches the house alone ♪

471
00:49:24,353 --> 00:49:27,220
Galchi, shh!

472
00:49:30,620 --> 00:49:33,120
Her temperature has decreased quite a bit now.

473
00:49:36,000 --> 00:49:38,940
Did you finish solving the math problems I gave you?

474
00:49:49,130 --> 00:49:50,890
Why is it so complicated?

475
00:49:50,890 --> 00:49:53,020
I can't solve it.

476
00:50:00,350 --> 00:50:03,130
Are you sure this is elementary school-level math?

477
00:50:03,130 --> 00:50:04,270
Yes.

478
00:50:12,410 --> 00:50:14,120
Empty your mind.

479
00:50:15,130 --> 00:50:19,280
Stop thinking about that guy.
Concentrate only on the ball.

480
00:50:19,280 --> 00:50:22,610
- Hey, listen!
- My name's not hey. It's Kang Hyeonwu.

481
00:50:22,610 --> 00:50:24,400
Hyeonwu.

482
00:50:24,400 --> 00:50:27,380
Don't move your wrist or your arm.

483
00:50:27,380 --> 00:50:29,750
Move your shoulder!

484
00:50:29,750 --> 00:50:32,020
Don't look at the ball flying when you hit it.

485
00:50:32,020 --> 00:50:34,400
Keep looking at the ground!

486
00:50:40,040 --> 00:50:41,400
Nice.

487
00:51:28,320 --> 00:51:31,590
I'm sorry, Mister.

488
00:52:16,270 --> 00:52:17,460
Get in.

489
00:52:59,550 --> 00:53:01,210
Minju, open the door!

490
00:53:02,610 --> 00:53:04,070
Open the door.

491
00:53:05,020 --> 00:53:07,120
Who is the bastard next to you?

492
00:53:07,880 --> 00:53:10,110
Who's that bastard sitting next to you?

493
00:53:11,650 --> 00:53:13,610
Open the door!

494
00:53:13,610 --> 00:53:18,510
Minju! Open it right now! Please!

495
00:53:18,510 --> 00:53:21,540
Minju!

496
00:53:23,630 --> 00:53:26,130
Open the door, please!

497
00:53:27,310 --> 00:53:29,040
Open the door!

498
00:53:30,100 --> 00:53:32,080
Open the door!

499
00:53:33,250 --> 00:53:34,730
Open the door!

500
00:53:36,290 --> 00:53:38,020
Open the door!

501
00:55:24,725 --> 00:55:28,837
Oh my gosh! Oh my!

502
00:55:36,450 --> 00:55:38,210
Uncle!

503
00:55:45,530 --> 00:55:47,030
Get on my back.

504
00:56:23,870 --> 00:56:26,520
[Text from Yun: Eunchae, I don't want to live anymore]

505
00:56:35,889 --> 00:56:38,205
[Deleting message]

506
00:58:34,777 --> 00:58:37,085
[Episode 9 Preview]

507
00:58:37,085 --> 00:58:39,694
There's somewhere you and I have to go to together.

508
00:58:40,403 --> 00:58:44,036
[Sorry, he is becoming closer to me]

509
00:58:44,036 --> 00:58:47,139
[But my heart has changed now...]

510
00:58:57,468 --> 00:59:00,901
[Love, Now I see her only]

511
00:59:00,901 --> 00:59:03,642
[But to me, she is sadness]

512
00:59:04,007 --> 00:59:06,414
Put me down!

513
00:59:07,525 --> 00:59:11,694
I won't go! I said I'm not going!

514
00:59:11,694 --> 00:59:17,005
That's a lot of tears for someone
who didn't drink any water.

515
00:59:17,005 --> 00:59:19,501
Stop the car.

516
00:59:19,501 --> 00:59:22,461
Would you rather eat or kiss me?

517
00:59:22,522 --> 00:59:24,051
Stop the car, now!

518
00:59:24,051 --> 00:59:26,146
Would you rather eat or sleep with me?

519
00:59:26,146 --> 00:59:27,866
Would you rather eat? Or just live with me?

520
00:59:27,866 --> 00:59:30,516
Would you rather eat?
Or would you rather...

521
00:59:30,516 --> 00:59:32,596
die with me?

522
01:00:08,494 --> 01:00:09,515
God.

523
01:00:11,571 --> 01:00:14,636
If you do exist,

524
01:00:15,110 --> 01:00:21,397
let me make a promise to you.

525
01:00:22,254 --> 01:00:24,418
In the time I have left,

526
01:00:25,205 --> 01:00:28,170
if I can have Eunchae next to me,

527
01:00:28,463 --> 01:00:33,735
if Eunchae can comfort my remaining time,

528
01:00:34,767 --> 01:00:37,737
I will quietly close my eyes.
